**Roles**: Student, Teacher (CD), Academic Director (DA), Admin

**Core Feature**: Thesis management + plagiarism detection (TF-IDF + Jaccard + N-gram)

**Security**: Custom HMAC sessions + RBAC middleware + rate-limit

**Tests**: 51 unit (Vitest) + 8 E2E (Playwright) + 16 Selenium (all passing ✅)

